SUMMARY:General Swim
DTSTART:20261030T100000Z
DTEND:20261030T105959Z
UID:gladstone-ALMPGS10000925-2026-10-30T10:00:00Z@activeleicester
DESCRIPTION:Spaces Remaining: 25\n\nChildren under 8 must be with a parent
  or responsible adult (16+) in the water. One adult may supervise up to 2 
 children under 8. Non-swimmers stay in specified areas. Shower before and 
 after swimming.\n\nBook session: https://activeleicester.gladstonego.cloud
 /book
LOCATION:Aylestone Leisure Centre - Main Pool Lane 1
END:VEVENT
